From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <dev@slothfulchat.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 19:09:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 70/77] web-app: enlarge Show Full Message tap target on touch
 devices
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The .show-html button is a bare text line (~17px tall, no padding), so
tapping "Show Full Message…" on phones often missed and hit the message
bubble instead. On coarse pointers, grow the hit box to ~37px with
padding canceled by negative margins — same trick as the navbar
buttons (0047) — so the bubble layout stays pixel-for-pixel identical.
---
 packages/frontend/scss/message/_message.scss | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message.scss b/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message.scss
index 40ecad8..768fec1 100644
--- a/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message.scss
+++ b/packages/frontend/scss/message/_message.scss
@@ -215,6 +215,18 @@ $info-text-max-width: 400px;
     &:hover {
       cursor: pointer;
     }
+
+    // Touch devices: the bare text line is a ~17px-tall tap target, so
+    // "Show Full Message…" taps often miss on phones. Grow the hit box with
+    // padding and cancel it with negative margins so the bubble layout stays
+    // pixel-for-pixel identical (same trick as the navbar buttons);
+    // position: relative paints the grown box above its neighbors so it wins
+    // the overlapped strip — a fingertip landing there meant the button.
+    @media (pointer: coarse) {
+      position: relative;
+      padding: 10px 12px 10px 0;
+      margin: -10px -12px -10px 0;
+    }
   }
 
   .download {
